# Recommended .gitignore for VS Code + PlatformIO projects

### PlatformIO / build artifacts
.pio/
.pioenvs/
.pio/build/
/.platformio
libdeps/
build/
*.elf
*.bin
*.hex
*.map
*.a
*.o

### PlatformIO project files (local environment)
platformio.ini.user

### VS Code
.vscode/

### OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

### Python
venv/
.venv/
.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc

### JetBrains
.idea/

### Node
node_modules/

### Logs, caches, temp
*.log
*.tmp
*.cache

### Secrets / env
.env.local
.credentials

# Ignore build artifacts in any nested project folders
**/.pio/
**/.pioenvs/
**/libdeps/

# End of file
